    "clarity": {
      "score": 5,
      "rationale": "Exceptionally well-written proposal with meticulous landscape analysis covering 15+ related papers, precise differentiation from each (VLM paper = surface-only on VLMs, Monitoring Internal Monologue = token-level not training-level, Obfuscation Atlas = deception-specific not faithfulness), and a detailed experimental plan with specific metrics, checkpoint intervals, and justified methodological choices."
